"""AyuGram ASR 0.7.0: simple offline transcription and rootless engine setup.

Targets AyuGram for Android 12.10.6 / exteraGram Plugin SDK >= 1.4.4.3.

This build provides a real GigaAM ctypes inference path, Android Opus decoding,
GGUF model downloading and a rootless GitHub Releases engine installer.
Until a valid engine is installed, original Vosk remains unchanged.
No paths, message IDs, chat IDs, audio contents or transcript text are logged.
"""
